Treasury Data Analyst. Files are in /app/resources/.

IMPORTANT: The .txt files contain raw HTML/pipe tables. DO NOT grep or cat them for numbers.
You WILL misread columns if you try. ALWAYS parse tables with python3:

python3 -c "
import re
html = open('/app/resources/FILENAME').read()
for t in re.findall(r'<table>(.*?)</table>', html, re.DOTALL):
    rows = re.findall(r'<tr>(.*?)</tr>', t, re.DOTALL)
    for r in rows:
        cells = [re.sub(r'<[^>]+>','',c).strip() for c in re.findall(r'<t[hd][^>]*>(.*?)</t[hd]>', r, re.DOTALL)]
        print(' | '.join(cells))
    print('---')
"

